-- נספחים ב'5 ו־ג'5 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים קיימים בדרגת 'בכיר' (קוד דירוג 104): the Ofek 2022 supplement of an existing teacher of the senior rank (בכיר)
-- (rating code 104), by grade — from 1.9.2022 (annex ב'5) and, twice as much,
-- from 1.9.2023 (annex ג'5) — as the conditions-of-service portal publishes
-- them: a page of the wage agreement of 19.10.2022 as signed, with its
-- hand-written page number and the parties' note that the annexes are
-- agreed. They are annexes ב5 and ג5 of that agreement, whose §5 pays the
-- supplement by them, and which the agreement's signed copy prints after
-- its signatures (encoded, imported).
--
-- Checked here: each is the signed copy's annex grade for grade, and
-- prints the day the signed copy's prints.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `base-agreement-46`
IMPORT `tables-common`
IMPORT `2025-01-14_ofek-hadash_vaadat-maakev_taut-sofer-correction_agorot-salary-tables`

§ `נספחים ב'5 ו־ג'5 — תוספת אופק 2022 למורים קיימים בדרגת 'בכיר' (קוד דירוג 104)`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 The annex's label, "נספח ב'5"; the table below it is annex ב'5.
-- akn:hc_1/p2 The page number written in by hand (10); no rule.
-- akn:hc_1/p5 The annex's label, "נספח ג'5"; the table below it is annex ג'5.
-- akn:hc_1/p8 "נספחים א1-א9, ב1-ב7 מוסכמים": the parties' note that the annexes are agreed; no rule of its own.

-- Annex ב'5, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.9.2022".
@ref akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/t1 akn:hc_1/p4
`annex ב'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים קיימים בדרגת 'בכיר' (קוד דירוג 104)" (JUST 104) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022)
        (LIST `cell` 1 594.58, `cell` 1.5 547.70, `cell` 2 500.83, `cell` 2.5 453.95, `cell` 3 407.08, `cell` 3.5 360.20, `cell` 4 313.33, `cell` 4.5 266.45, `cell` 5 219.58, `cell` 5.5 172.70, `cell` 6 125.83, `cell` 6.5 97.70, `cell` 7 69.58, `cell` 7.5 41.45, `cell` 8 13.33, `cell` 8.5 6.66, `cell` 9 0.00)

-- Annex ג'5, as it prints under it: "מעודכן החל מיום 1.9.2023".
@ref akn:hc_1/p6 akn:hc_1/t2 akn:hc_1/p7
`annex ג'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` MEANS
    `a published supplement` "תוספת אופק 2022 למורים קיימים בדרגת 'בכיר' (קוד דירוג 104)" (JUST 104) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2023)
        (LIST `cell` 1 1189.16, `cell` 1.5 1095.41, `cell` 2 1001.66, `cell` 2.5 907.91, `cell` 3 814.16, `cell` 3.5 720.41, `cell` 4 626.66, `cell` 4.5 532.91, `cell` 5 439.16, `cell` 5.5 345.41, `cell` 6 251.66, `cell` 6.5 195.41, `cell` 7 139.16, `cell` 7.5 82.91, `cell` 8 26.66, `cell` 8.5 13.33, `cell` 9 0.00)

§§ `בדיקת הטבלאות`

-- (1) The days each prints, as the signed copy's annexes print them.
#ASSERT `annex ב'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ב5 of the signed copy`
#ASSERT `annex ג'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`'s `published supplement from` EQUALS `the day the annex prints` `annex ג5 of the signed copy`

-- (2) The signed copy's annexes ב5 and ג5, grade for grade, seventeen grades
-- each (1 to 9 by halves).
GIVEN a IS A `signed-copy annex`
GIVETH A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the signed copy's supplement for rating 104 in` a IS
    GIVEN g YIELD `the signed-copy cell` (`the first table of` a) 0 g

#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 104 in` `annex ב5 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT null (`the published misses in` (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 104 in` `annex ג5 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`))
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 104 in` `annex ב5 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ב'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT count (`the published supplement beside` (`the signed copy's supplement for rating 104 in` `annex ג5 of the signed copy`) `in` `annex ג'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement`) EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `the annex as the decision of 14.1.2025 has it` `annex ב5 of the signed copy` EQUALS `annex ב5 of the signed copy`

-- The supplements at work: §5's supplement for a full position at grade
-- 1.5 on 1.9.2022, as the signed copy pays it, beside annex ב'5.
#ASSERT `the published supplement on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) `annex ב'5 of the Ofek 2022 supplement` 1.5 EQUALS `the Ofek 2022 supplement under the signed copy's annexes` 5 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2022) 1.5 1
